  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 715.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 715.02 Applicability. This part shall apply to:\n\n(a) Each community water system or non-transient non-community water system at which any chemical disinfectant, including chlorine dioxide, is added to the water in any part of the treatment process; and\n\n(b) Each transient non-community water system at which chlorine dioxide is added as a disinfectant or oxidant to the water in any part of the treatment process.\n\nSource. #9619, eff 1-1-10; ss by #12532, eff 6-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
}
